{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"b875af4c-ad10-4930-be15-a4975f7d8224","status":"SUCCESS","response":"An investigation of [`FrequencyTest.java`](file:///Users/nothing/prometheus_workdir_microstudy/math_75_group_a_blind/src/test/java/org/apache/commons/math/stat/FrequencyTest.java#L148) revealed that [`Frequency.getPct(Object v)`](file:///Users/nothing/prometheus_workdir_microstudy/math_75_group_a_blind/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/math/stat/Frequency.java#L302-L304) erroneously delegated to `getCumPct((Comparable\u003c?\u003e) v)` instead of `getPct((Comparable\u003c?\u003e) v)`.\n\n### Root Cause\nIn [`Frequency.java`](file:///Users/nothing/prometheus_workdir_microstudy/math_75_group_a_blind/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/math/stat/Frequency.java):\n```java\n    @Deprecated\n    public double getPct(Object v) {\n        return getCumPct((Comparable\u003c?\u003e) v);\n    }\n```\nCalling `getPct(Object)` returned cumulative percentage rather than percentage of values equal to `v`.\n\n### Fix\nUpdated [`getPct(Object v)`](file:///Users/nothing/prometheus_workdir_microstudy/math_75_group_a_blind/src/main/java/org/apache/commons/math/stat/Frequency.java#L302-L304) to call `getPct((Comparable\u003c?\u003e) v)`:\n```java\n    @Deprecated\n    public double getPct(Object v) {\n        return getPct((Comparable\u003c?\u003e) v);\n    }\n```\n\nThe fix was verified and `org.apache.commons.math.stat.FrequencyTest::testPcts` passes. The patch has been saved to [blind_fix.patch](file:///Users/nothing/prometheus_workdir_microstudy/math_75_group_a_blind/blind_fix.patch).\n","duration_seconds":76.570664,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":247860,"output_tokens":6421,"thinking_tokens":3204,"cache_read_tokens":589386,"total_tokens":254281}}}
